        isPlayer: 1
        target: {fileID: 0}
      displayTexts:
      - 'The baby cries in your hands. You look to the Priest on the left side and
        with a heart full of love, you gently hand the baby to him. The priest smiles
        and gives you an approving nod. "Thank you, kind one. We will treat this
        sapling with our best care and bring him closer to the Hand of S. Perhaps
        he will become the chosen Vessel." He looks at you with warm eyes. '
      - He continues, "Sometimes it is the young who are the closest to the Faith.
        Religion of S often speaks of the 0. Representing emptiness, the only method
        by which openness can be born. Not letting ego or preconceived judgment rule
        over. Instead, allowing the flow of the true self to take form, growing alongside
        the Faith bestowed by the Hand of S."
      experiencePointsChange: 0
    failingConsequences: []
