      displayTexts:
      - You look to the Priest on the left and show him your Coin of S. He smiles
        warmly. "Ah, a recent Follower of S," he says. "I always enjoy meeting a
        new follower, and hopefully we can take good care of you, and you, in return,
        take care of yourself and grow your faith with S."
      - He hands you a thin book. "Please take this Religious Text of S., and when
        you are ready, you may hang your coin on the Roots on the ceiling of this
        room. But please come visit me whenever."
