  UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts:
  - name_: Angry observe
    UseEmotionKey: 0
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - On the left side is a man with a red, luscious robe and a crown with a gold
      "0" icon on it. Your mind does not produce any sort of innate understanding
      of this person. However, the crown does remind you a little of its immense
      importance in the Religion of S. A symbol of closeness with the Hand of Spawn.
  - name_: Joy voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You happily greet the Priest on the left. He smiles back. It is friendly and
      kind, a departure from the atmosphere you have experienced in this place. "Thank
      you for visiting us, young one. May I share an excerpt from our Religious Text
      of S with you?"
    - You nod enthusiastically. He opens his book and recites, "0 is not null. It
      is not none. It is empty to be full. A container cannot fill without allowing
      itself to be empty. We must learn to be 0, for it is harder to be 0 than infinity.
      Once we can accept ourselves as a vessel capable of more, then do we begin
      learning." He closes the book. "I hope you welcome our teachings as a 0. For
      we are all 0's here, eager to learn. For we are yours, Spawns"
  - name_: Angry voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You growled angrily at the Priest on the left. Not even an intelligible word
      could be heard. Regardless, the Priest smiled warmly towards you. "I understand.
      This place can be difficult for many. These trials are just developing us to
      be better. Every version of you re-born is given another chance to improve.
      And eventually, you will satisfy the Hand of S to be freed."
  - name_: Fear voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - 'Your mind can''t handle the pressures and stress of the labyrinth, and you
      let out a scream of terror towards the Priest on the left. Without a word,
      he embraces you in a hug. "Now, now, my son. Do not show weakness here. Be
      stronger. Hand of S will not be happy to see one of his creation become a failure.
      Endure, my child. Endure and grow." '
  - name_: Sad voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 1
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - A tear is shed, and a sob is let out towards the Priest on the left. The Priest
      puts a hand on your shoulder, giving you space to cry it out. He mutters a
      prayer, "Hand of S, please overlook this moment of weakness. I know in this
      young man, there is a potential to become a use for you. I can tell he is much
      stronger than his last one. Please do not kill this man. Let him prove himself.
      For we are yours, Spawns."
  - name_: Joy Gut
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 2
    displayTexts:
    - Your gut tells you that the Priest on the left is a gentle and wonderful soul.
      However, your gut also tells you that not all good intentions come from good
      sources.
  - name_: Sad Gut
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 1
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 2
    displayTexts:
    - Your gut tells you that the Priest on the left is here to cure our sadness.
      To interpret the Religion of S for us. To communicate to the Hand of S for
      us. All to provide a reasoning for our suffering.
